WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.980
That's my BFF, the director's daughter!

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:07.080
You actually got a speed wall set up!

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.730
I've been asking for one for a while.

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:12.680
Now we can go all-in on 
speed climbing training.

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:19.210
Sorry, but leave.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:22.440
What's the matter?

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.870
What has you looking so glum?

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:27.960
I went to see Jun-chan, but I...

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.980
I don't think you need to 
worry about that anymore.

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:40.620
Jun-chan?

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:03.660
<b><i>Iwakakeru!</i></b>

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:20.330
I can't tell you how happy 
I am to have you back.

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:21.490
I'm sorry.

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:25.720
You came to see me at the gym and all, 
but I just gave you the cold shoulder.

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:27.000
<b><i> Wall 10               Restart!</i></b>

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:29.500
Don't be. I shouldn't have shown up
 unannounced like that.

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:33.880
I, uh, squared off against 
Uchimura after you left.

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:35.630
Akane-san?

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:42.140
She showed up at my workplace, ran her mouth,

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:43.640
and then challenged me.

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:47.270
It shouldn't have come as a surprise. 
She's always been like that.

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:54.910
But it helped me remember what I was like
when I first picked up climbing,

00:02:54.910 --> 00:02:56.820
and how fun it could be.

00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:03.160
Uh...

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:06.190
That doesn't mean she 
deserves all the credit!

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:08.150
I don't owe her a thing.

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:10.380
Wh-What's so funny?

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:12.570
Nothing. Just glad to hear it.

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:15.320
But... it's also a little upsetting.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:18.730
Maybe I'm envious of Akane-san.

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:20.970
You two are, like, friendly rivals.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:24.150
Yeah, right. More like I can't 
seem to get away from her.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:26.930
The only one I consider a rival is...

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:31.940
Never mind.

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:35.080
Konomi, let's work together 
as Hanamiya teammates again.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.940
Yeah, of course!

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:42.240
Just like you, I'm really 
loving climbing right now!

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:46.380
I'm so glad you're back.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:51.080
Without my straight man, 
I can't play the fool to full effect.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:54.970
"Play" the fool? I thought 
it came naturally to you.

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:55.750
Huh?

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:58.030
That's Sayo-chin, not me.

00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:59.540
What? Really?

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:04.810
All right. Shall we get right to practice?

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:05.390
Jun.

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:08.750
Can I ask you to bring Konomi-san 
up to speed on speed climbing?

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:09.390
Has nobody noticed Sayo-chin's 
kinda got a screw loose?

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:09.390
Sure.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.890
I'm ready for anything you can throw at me.

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:13.960
How is that possible?

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:16.900
Well, start with showing me 
what you've got right now.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:16.900
Is it because I'm too good at the role?

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.090
Okay.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:29.960
<i>Speed climbing is all about how fast you can 
climb a 15-meter wall with a set route.</i>

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:32.160
<i>It's basically the 100-meter 
dash of climbing.</i>

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:33.660
Ready?

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:35.040
Yeah.

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:41.550
<i>Urk, I knew it.</i>

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:44.190
<i>For a wall that's supposed 
to be climbed quickly,</i>

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:46.490
<i>why is each hold spaced so far out?</i>

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:51.180
<i>They're all sloped and hard to grab, too!</i>

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:57.190
23.87 seconds.

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:01.040
Here.

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:03.950
Thanks. How good is 23.87 seconds?

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:07.820
The average among female high-school 
competitors is 16 to 17 seconds.

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:10.590
Pros clock in around 12.

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:12.940
Even if speed isn't your strong suit...

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:15.830
If you wanna qualify for 
the Combined Cup finals,

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.360
you've gotta break 15 seconds.

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:18.570
15 seconds?!

00:05:18.570 --> 00:05:19.790
Let me try again!

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:20.460
Wait, Konomi.

00:05:21.240 --> 00:05:23.210
Huh?

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:28.680
What? I only made one attempt, 
so why am I this tired already?

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.250
Don't rush things, Konomi.

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:35.360
Just climbing repeatedly won't help you.

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:37.480
You have to analyze the nitty-gritties first.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.830
Nitty-gritties?

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:45.850
Speed climbing consumes a lot 
of energy with each attempt.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:47.240
Given that,

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:52.160
you could split the course into 
top, middle, and bottom sections

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:54.750
and carefully weed out each 
part you have difficulty with.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:57.820
That won't require as much stamina.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:01.720
For us to win,

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:05.700
each one of us has to get 
our times below 15 seconds.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:09.310
Start with physical training.

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:11.640
Lower-body strength is key in speed climbing.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:14.520
Increase your vertical by 
doing single-leg hurdles.

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:19.270
You need arm strength not only to pull yourself up 
on holds, but also to push down on them.

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:23.770
Work on your push strength by 
bouncing a slam ball over and over.

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:27.780
The dynos in the top and middle sections 
are the cruxes on the speed wall.

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:31.180
Work on them one at a time and 
make sure you can nail them.

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:32.280
Got it.

00:06:32.690 --> 00:06:34.660
The route is the same everywhere.

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:36.780
Climb it over and over

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:39.160
and make your body memorize it.

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:42.170
Teach it the moves that 
help you climb the fastest!

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:45.300
<i>We will be the best team in Japan!</i>

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:49.300
<i>Aw...</i>

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:53.690
<i>I thought my moves had gotten better, 
but my time hasn't changed.</i>

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:54.760
Konomi-san.

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:57.810
Captain... And Jun-chan.

00:06:58.160 --> 00:07:03.200
There's a multi-school speed training camp 
over the long weekend coming up.

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:05.320
We're both taking part, Konomi.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.880
A speed training camp...

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:14.070
Whoa.

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:19.830
Hey, aren't the Captain 
and Nono-san taking part?

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:22.520
They're practicing one-on-one.

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:24.100
Besides, this camp is for...

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:27.710
Of course mew two would be here.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:31.590
You may have fared better than 
me in the last competition,

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:32.950
but speed is my...

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:35.520
Konomi, let's get ready 
before everyone gets here.

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:38.520
Don't ignore my appurreance!

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.960
Oh, I didn't notice you there, Uchimura.

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:41.600
Well, see ya.

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:43.710
"See ya," my ass!

00:07:43.710 --> 00:07:46.610
Don't you realize how blessed you are by 
Akane-chan-sama the Great's presence?!

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:49.320
You're more like a curse.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:51.200
What you say?!

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:51.990
Get off me.

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:54.960
Uh, when did these two get so close?

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:55.990
Goodness gracious.

00:07:56.640 --> 00:08:00.250
You ladies are as sprightly as little 
children on a school trip.

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:01.870
Ooba-san?

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.650
Bonjour, Kasahara-san.

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:08.200
I have heard lots about your 
stellar performances recently.

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.400
You seem to be in wonderful touch,

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:14.160
but that only applies to bouldering.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:18.640
The upcoming Combined Cup will judge you 
on all three disciplines, including speed.

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:20.140
I wonder...

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:23.230
Will you be able to shine 
just as brightly in speed?

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:26.150
Ever since I tragically 
lost to you last time,

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:29.820
I have done nothing but practice 
for days... weeks... months!

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:33.310
While the time may not yet 
be ripe to repay the favor,

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:38.990
I am very much giddy about climbing 
with you during this camp.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.590
Be seeing you soon!

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:49.500
What is her problem? 
Talk about grinding your gears.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.880
You're one to talk.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:57.580
I don't know why, but she really 
does seem to have it out for you.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:59.790
A sign of her confidence, it is.

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:01.530
Satou Maruno.

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:03.850
Having seen Kasahara-san bouldering,

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:08.310
she must've surmised that she wouldn't 
be as good at speed, thus provoking her.

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:14.320
Kasahara-san <i>is</i> the rookie who made 
the finals, the eye of the hurricane!

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:18.320
I can understand wanting 
to mess with her, I can.

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.500
Oh, dear!

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:25.480
I overheard your conversation and 
unknowingly went into analytic mode!

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:28.350
I beg your forgiveness, I do!

00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:29.200
That said,

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:33.680
I shall take Kasahara-san's 
head in the Combined Cup.

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:35.970
See you on the battlefield!

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:40.470
Wow, look at Li'l Miss Pawpular over here.

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:44.470
You've got everyone on your tail. I'm envious.

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:43.100
<i><i>A multi-school training camp...</i></i>

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:48.800
<i><i>I was expecting others to pile the pressure 
on Konomi here, but not this badly.</i></i>

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:47.960
You're like a superstar. 
I want people to come after me, too,

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:51.760
and give me monikers like 
"Murder Observation," too!

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:52.780
Uchimura.

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:55.980
What is wrong with you?

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:57.100
Jun-chan.

00:09:57.920 --> 00:10:01.130
I'm glad I came to this camp.

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:05.040
There are so many people here 
who want to compete with me.

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.040
I'll do my best, okay?

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.040
I'll produce a time that 
won't lose to any of them!

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:10.700
That's the spirit.

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:14.170
Incredible drive.

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:16.600
Even when you're fully clothed, I can tell...

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:23.280
Compared to last time, your biceps and 
extensor muscles look more developed.

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:26.180
So do your gastrocnemii, 
the engines that power your speed.

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:29.720
Kasahara Konomi, you really are...

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:31.400
oh so wonderful!

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.360
Konomi? Konomi!

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:38.460
This is the organizer of this training camp,

00:10:38.460 --> 00:10:40.170
routesetter Nakata-san.

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:41.200
Let's do this!

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:42.910
R-Right!

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:44.490
Thank you for having us!

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:45.560
Thank you.

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:46.470
Mew.

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:51.280
Welcome to Nakata Camp, everyone.

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:54.210
Some of you may have realized by 
looking at the other participants,

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:58.260
but everyone here is a 
top-performing first-year.

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:02.970
Currently, there aren't many 
facilities that offer a speed wall,

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:07.220
and some of you have never 
even touched one in your life.

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.040
But that won't do!

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:13.230
So, I organized this camp for first-years.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:17.610
Speed climbing is a discipline that has 
a place in the world championships, too.

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:21.490
You won't be here for long, 
but practice all you can

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:25.240
and grow into climbers who will carry 
Japan's name in the years to come!

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:30.400
We'll start by timing your attempts.

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:31.500
Okay!

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:44.260
<i>What's my time?</i>

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:49.140
<i>I'm still way off 15 seconds...</i>

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:51.390
<i>What about the others?</i>

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:53.400
<b>Hoshi Manami</b>

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:53.400
<b>Uchimura Akane</b>

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:53.400
<b>Satou Maruno</b>

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:53.400
<b>Ooba Kurea</b>

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:53.400
<b>Takahashi Eri</b>

00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:58.380
Oh? I see you've finished, too.

00:11:58.380 --> 00:11:59.530
What is your time?

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.530
<b>Ooshima Rika</b>

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.530
<b>Uehara Jun</b>

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.530
<b>Kasahara Konomi</b>

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.530
<b>Saitou Chiaki</b>

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:06.810
Wow, that's a nice time. It puts you 
up there with the highest in this camp.

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:13.560
That said, there are many here climbing 
a speed wall for the first time.

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:18.250
You're lucky enough to have a speed 
wall at school and this is your time?

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.460
It's a disappointment and a half.

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:29.720
What's the matter?
 Why are you sulking over here?

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:31.430
Nakata-san.

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:35.500
It's only natural that your 
time would lag behind.

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:38.600
Why do you think you came to this camp?

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:41.940
Take a look around.

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:46.040
Look at all the climbers 
I brought to this camp.

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:51.240
At this training camp,

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:55.600
you can see how climbers from 
other schools do things for once,

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:57.960
and pick up new ideas for yourself.

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:03.080
Steal techniques, have yours stolen,

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:05.760
compete with each other, and grow together!

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:09.210
Add a little extra to your beauty!

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:11.870
And then, transform from 
a pupa to a butterfly,

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:16.940
take flight from my hands, and one 
day soar the skies across the world!

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:21.440
This training camp is a nest built 
for beautiful butterflies to emerge!

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:20.710
Nakata-san! Thank you!

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:24.350
<i>Nakata-san's right.</i>

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:26.200
<i>It doesn't matter if I'm lagging behind now.</i>

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:31.200
<i>I'll use this camp and its participants 
to pick up hints for getting faster.</i>

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.180
<i>Anything will do.</i>

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:40.330
<i>And, finally, I'll figure out 
a way to climb my fastest!</i>

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:42.340
<i>I have to!</i>

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:46.970
<i>Maruno-san skips over the 
wall with her tiny body.</i>

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:55.230
Okay.

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:04.280
<i>I see. She can only do this because she's 
memorized the holds and their locations.</i>

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:06.620
<i>She climbs by internalizing each move...</i>

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:08.970
<i>That's Maruno-san's advantage.</i>

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:09.740
<i>And...</i>

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:14.730
<i>Ooba-san climbs with beautiful posture, 
as only a former ballerina could.</i>

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:16.910
<i>Her core and head remain 
extraordinarily steady,</i>

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:19.710
<i>eliminating any concern of her falling.</i>

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.920
<i>The angle at which she 
looks upwards is perfect.</i>

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:31.760
<i>Most climbers tilt their head too far back, 
directing their momentum backwards, too.</i>

00:14:32.170 --> 00:14:34.010
<i>But her core and posture</i>

00:14:35.110 --> 00:14:37.230
<i>remain stable even at high speeds.</i>

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.450
<i>That's Ooba-san's advantage.</i>

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:43.610
<i>It's interesting how they're 
climbing the same wall,</i>

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:46.010
<i>and yet they all climb it 
in their own, unique way.</i>

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:54.870
Okay.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:58.000
We'll time you once more 
to finish up the first day.

00:15:01.010 --> 00:15:03.280
<i>I watched how they all climb and practice,</i>

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:05.280
<i>absorbed the key points,</i>

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:08.140
<i>and worked on making them mine.</i>

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:11.380
<i>Now, I just have to put them into practice!</i>

00:15:12.430 --> 00:15:14.890
On your marks, ready...

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:20.390
<i>I  internalized the moves required better</i>

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:23.550
<i>and adjusted my center 
of gravity and posture.</i>

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:25.500
<i>I even changed how I use my ankles</i>

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:27.910
<i>and how I place my feet on footholds.</i>

00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:29.480
<i>It's working!</i>

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:31.670
<i>I should hit 15 seconds with this!</i>

00:15:35.650 --> 00:15:37.410
<i>Great! What's my time?</i>

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:38.740
<i>Huh?</i>

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:43.290
<i>It's even slower than earlier?</i>

00:15:44.340 --> 00:15:45.620
<i>Why?</i>

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:57.960
My, what's this, Kasahara-san?

00:15:57.960 --> 00:16:00.310
Why the gloomy face?

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:02.620
Oh, that was insensitive of me.

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:05.520
Of course you would be gloomy

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:08.440
after climbing so disgracefully earlier.

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:15.720
I assume you tried to copy 
someone else's style,

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:19.560
but you were moving so awkwardly, 
you looked like a puppet up there.

00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:27.050
Can you really shorten your time in 
the two days of camp we have left?

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:32.680
Your analytic skills may have landed you 
some decent results in lead and bouldering,

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:35.220
but speed appears to be your Achilles heel.

00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:40.410
That makes it impossible for Hanamiya's 
tiny team to get past the prelims.

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:46.160
All because their promising rookie, 
Kasahara Konomi, is like a turtle in speed!

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:48.010
Yeah...

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:50.980
Wait.

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:52.240
What?

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:05.500
Have you managed to calm down some?

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:07.180
Thanks.

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:10.750
Sorry I started crying and stuff.

00:17:11.720 --> 00:17:13.010
Don't be.

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:19.720
<i>She was so confident in that competition, 
and seemed to be enjoying herself.</i>

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:21.160
<i>Where did that girl go?</i>

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:24.680
I suck so much, huh?

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:31.760
I tried to learn your tips and tricks, 
but I couldn't use them right.

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:34.900
Heck, my time got worse, even.

00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:39.410
If I'm wasting my precious time 
at speed camp like this,

00:17:39.770 --> 00:17:43.660
I might not even make it past 
the prelims, like you said.

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:47.170
And winning is just out of...

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:55.670
Look...

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:00.480
Look what you've made me do!

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:03.680
I've never slapped anyone in my life before!

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:06.180
Oh, sorry.

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:11.690
Ever since I lost to you, I've focused 
all my energy on beating you.

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:15.440
And look at you...

00:18:15.850 --> 00:18:19.320
Why are you acting like such a loser? 
So what if you're a little slow?!

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:23.330
This isn't the version of you I want to best!

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:29.340
Oh, for the love of... My hand hurts.

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:31.960
How am I supposed to grab holds like this?

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:34.460
Uh... Sorry...

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:38.340
What's so funny?

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:41.180
I mean, you apologized to
 someone who slapped you?

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:45.850
I did, but it did feel like 
I did something wrong...

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:48.890
Well, that is very like you.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.190
It is?

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:53.000
Anyway, good thing you got yelled at, huh?

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:53.860
Yeah.

00:18:54.170 --> 00:18:57.110
Uchimura snapped at me, too, actually.

00:18:57.110 --> 00:19:00.860
Huh, really? What did she say?

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:03.370
Uh, well...

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:06.370
I couldn't tell through all her cat talk.

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:11.620
It looks like you and I are 
more similar than we think.

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:13.250
Jun-chan...

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:19.900
And, because of that, I can tell 
why your time didn't get better.

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:24.200
It was you climbing that wall, 
but it wasn't your brand of climbing.

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:30.200
You tried so hard to incorporate
 others' ideas, it became a jumbled mess.

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:31.480
A mess?

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:35.770
Whether you're able to pick up skills 
and whether those skills are suited to you

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:37.700
are two completely different things.

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:41.340
Don't go chasing shadows 
and lose sight of yourself.

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:44.910
Pick, choose, and learn 
only what works for you.

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:49.710
True. I might have panicked and tried 
to do too many things at once.

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:51.660
But what else can I do?

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:55.840
You'll have to figure that out for yourself.

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:57.920
That's how anyone develops.

00:19:57.920 --> 00:20:01.800
They fight, struggle, and 
scale the walls in their way.

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:04.720
Easy for you to say.

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:07.130
I'm not strong like you.

00:20:07.130 --> 00:20:09.560
Nah, I was in that place, too.

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:15.610
During the Kanto Championships, 
I was so overwhelmed by your climbing

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:17.420
my hands stopped moving right.

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:23.630
I turned my back on all sorts of things 
in life to become a better climber.

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:27.330
But you overtook me like 
none of it meant anything.

00:20:27.640 --> 00:20:30.940
I lost sight of myself,

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:33.720
and I became scared of climbing.

00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:34.960
Jun-chan...

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:38.000
So, have more faith in yourself.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:40.810
Look what you put <i>me</i> through!

00:20:40.810 --> 00:20:44.470
Do everything you can to scale 
the wall blocking your path now.

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:49.180
Overcome it and grow stronger, like I did.

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:51.260
Don't cry.

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:53.550
Sorry, Jun-chan.

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:54.980
Don't apologize, either.

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:56.830
Okay.

00:20:56.830 --> 00:20:58.500
Thanks, Jun-chan.

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:02.470
I'll try a little bit harder.

00:21:05.920 --> 00:21:08.650
<i>After all those things I said yesterday,</i>

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:10.860
<i>I'll have to give it my 
absolute best from here.</i>

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:13.500
<i>Someone's here.</i>

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:16.000
<i>They're practicing so early?</i>

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:19.610
<i>That's more like it.</i>

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:22.410
<i>This is why you're such a worthy target.</i>

00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:33.770
<i>This is hard.</i>

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:37.610
<i>Exactly how am I supposed to 
pick up skills that suit me?</i>

00:21:38.050 --> 00:21:41.270
<i>I have to try to find a way today.</i>

